  "basis": "SIMULATED. Written by hand from the output checks of obs-websocket 5.7.6 (commit e28f849), as the T20 research lists them: 500 OutputRunning and 501 OutputNotRunning. videoActive means that any video output is live: stream, recording, replay buffer or virtual camera. The comments are the obs-websocket source texts. Not captured from OBS: a real capture replaces this file.",
